{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-216592","model_call":24,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"disability insurance\" \"financial plan\" \"protect your income\")"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"disability insurance\" \"financial plan\" \"protect your income\")"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_916861923#0_1691032690","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1179","rank":1,"snippet":"STEP \" , \"segment\": \"What’s the Difference Between Workers’ Comp and Disability Insurance? | Northwestern Mutual Money Basics Understanding Insurance What’s the Difference Between Workers’ Comp and Disability Insurance? By Tim Stobierski, October 07, 2019 Facebook logo icon Twitter logo icon LinkedIn logo icon Envelope icon<cover>Disability insurance and workers’ comp are similar but they’re used differently. Hero Images / Getty A solid financial plan helps you save for future goals, but it should also include insurance to protect against the things that could get in the way of those goals. Health insurance helps protect against massive, unexpected medical bills. Life insurance protects families financially in the event of death. Car and homeowner’s insurance protect against unexpected damage. There’s even pet insurance to protect against surprise vet bills. Then there’s workers’ compensation and disability income insurance, which protect your income </cover>if an illness or injury prevents you from working. And while they are similar, there’s a key difference between the two financial tools.\" , \"start_char\": 0.000000 , \"title\": \"What’s the Difference Between Workers’ Comp and Disability Insurance? | Northwestern "},"time":63},"model_calls":24,"document_judgments":21,"relevance_3":16,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
