{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-216592","model_call":28,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"disability insurance\" \"pay bills\" (+ illness injury disabled))"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"disability insurance\" \"pay bills\" (+ illness injury disabled))"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_44_387848017#2_964118077","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1181","rank":1,"snippet":"employee satisfaction. The Hartford has an excellent reputation of 4.8/5 and is one of the longest-running insurance providers in the United States. Most consumers have only positive opinions about their plan with the Hartford, whether they have a long- or short-term policy. What Disability Insurance Does The Hartford Offer? The Hartford offers three main disability insurance plans which include short-term disability, long-term disability, and group disability insurance. The Hartford has many features in place to ensure you are truly getting the help you need. They work with employers to enable them to provide coverage to their employees. Short-term <cover>Disability Insurance The short-term option from Hartford helps employees during their time of need. The Hartford offers some of the best policies to help pay bills and personal expenses during their recovery from illness </cover>or injury. Since most plans are flexible, they can be changed to fit each situation uniquely.\" , \"start_char\": 1206.000000 , \"title\": \"The Hartford Disability Insurance Review for 2020 | Long & Short Term\" , \"url\": \"https://www.insuranceblogbychris.com/hartford-disability-insurance-review/\" }"},"time":119},"model_calls":28,"document_judgments":25,"relevance_3":19,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
