{"actor":"model","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-216592","model_call":50,"attempt":1,"model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input_tokens":23734,"output_tokens":381,"total_tokens":24115,"cached_tokens":22784,"reasoning_tokens":190},"output_characters":920,"decision":{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_54_274979302#4_616832825","relevance":2,"reason":"The passage provides direct supporting evidence that disability insurance protects the ability to generate income, that disability risk can exceed death risk, and that months without income can quickly consume savings. However, the document is a broader financial safety net article rather than dedicated to disability insurance.","learned":"Supporting evidence: disability insurance can be a smart investment because it insures income-generating ability and helps prevent a temporary disability from wiping out years of savings."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"disability insurance\" \"cover your expenses\" \"unable to work\")","reason":"Search for dedicated disability insurance pages that directly explain coverage as a way to cover expenses when someone is unable to work, a strong smart-investment rationale."}}}
