{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-216592","model_call":52,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1193"},"record":{"query":{"op":"next","qid":"q1193"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_41_2062771509#7_3383750369","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1193","rank":2,"snippet":"term benefit periods? What’s the difference between short term and long term coverage levels? Disability insurance calculator What’s the elimination period? Which do I need: need short term disability insurance or long term disability insurance? Success story: Dr. Feranmi Okanlami Do I need both short term and long term disability insurance? How do I get disability insurance? How do I get individual disability insurance? \" , \"segment\": \"If not, short term <cover>disability insurance is an essential financial protection, even if you are disabled for only a short period of time. If you have significant emergency savings on hand, though, you may focus on how a long term disability could impact your financial wellbeing and your retirement plans. </cover>If you were permanently disabled, could you cover your expenses until retirement? If not, look into long term disability protection. Success story: Dr. Feranmi Okanlami Feranmi Okanlami was a star athlete and orthopedic surgery resident when an accident forever changed the course of his life. Watch his inspiring story to see how disability insurance helped him recover and return to a career in medicine. Do I need both short term and long term disability insurance? As you ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_41_2062771509#6_3383748471","rank":1,"relevance":3}]},"time":1},"model_calls":52,"document_judgments":47,"relevance_3":35,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
